{"fps": 30, "frames": 1709, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 128, "text": "A loan from sixteen forty-eight still pays interest today.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 0, "e": 2}, {"w": "loan", "f": 5, "e": 11}, {"w": "from", "f": 14, "e": 18}, {"w": "sixteen", "f": 21, "e": 37}, {"w": "forty-eight", "f": 40, "e": 53}, {"w": "still", "f": 59, "e": 66}, {"w": "pays", "f": 69, "e": 75}, {"w": "interest", "f": 78, "e": 89}, {"w": "today.", "f": 96, "e": 117}]}, {"a": 128, "b": 249, "text": "Imagine you run a Dutch water board, and the river's eating your dike.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 130, "e": 144}, {"w": "you", "f": 146, "e": 149}, {"w": "run", "f": 151, "e": 153}, {"w": "a", "f": 155, "e": 158}, {"w": "Dutch", "f": 159, "e": 165}, {"w": "water", "f": 169, "e": 176}, {"w": "board,", "f": 178, "e": 190}, {"w": "and", "f": 191, "e": 192}, {"w": "the", "f": 194, "e": 195}, {"w": "river's", "f": 197, "e": 210}, {"w": "eating", "f": 214, "e": 217}, {"w": "your", "f": 219, "e": 222}, {"w": "dike.", "f": 224, "e": 235}]}, {"a": 249, "b": 327, "text": "So you write a promise on goatskin.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 251, "e": 258}, {"w": "you", "f": 265, "e": 267}, {"w": "write", "f": 270, "e": 272}, {"w": "a", "f": 273, "e": 274}, {"w": "promise", "f": 277, "e": 288}, {"w": "on", "f": 290, "e": 293}, {"w": "goatskin.", "f": 295, "e": 320}]}, {"a": 327, "b": 460, "text": "Lend us a thousand guilders, and we'll pay five percent. Forever.", "words": [{"w": "Lend", "f": 329, "e": 334}, {"w": "us", "f": 336, "e": 338}, {"w": "a", "f": 341, "e": 343}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 345, "e": 357}, {"w": "guilders,", "f": 359, "e": 375}, {"w": "and", "f": 376, "e": 377}, {"w": "we'll", "f": 379, "e": 384}, {"w": "pay", "f": 386, "e": 389}, {"w": "five", "f": 393, "e": 398}, {"w": "percent.", "f": 402, "e": 422}, {"w": "Forever.", "f": 427, "e": 451}]}, {"a": 460, "b": 547, "text": "A man named Niclaes de Meijer signs.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 462, "e": 464}, {"w": "man", "f": 466, "e": 471}, {"w": "named", "f": 473, "e": 480}, {"w": "Niclaes", "f": 482, "e": 496}, {"w": "de", "f": 498, "e": 501}, {"w": "Meijer", "f": 503, "e": 512}, {"w": "signs.", "f": 514, "e": 538}]}, {"a": 547, "b": 645, "text": "Soon the rate gets halved, but the payments keep coming.", "words": [{"w": "Soon", "f": 549, "e": 555}, {"w": "the", "f": 558, "e": 560}, {"w": "rate", "f": 563, "e": 567}, {"w": "gets", "f": 570, "e": 574}, {"w": "halved,", "f": 576, "e": 592}, {"w": "but", "f": 594, "e": 597}, {"w": "the", "f": 598, "e": 599}, {"w": "payments", "f": 601, "e": 613}, {"w": "keep", "f": 615, "e": 619}, {"w": "coming.", "f": 622, "e": 633}]}, {"a": 645, "b": 768, "text": "They're scribbled on the goatskin till it's full, so they attach paper.", "words": [{"w": "They're", "f": 647, "e": 654}, {"w": "scribbled", "f": 656, "e": 665}, {"w": "on", "f": 666, "e": 667}, {"w": "the", "f": 669, "e": 670}, {"w": "goatskin", "f": 672, "e": 686}, {"w": "till", "f": 688, "e": 690}, {"w": "it's", "f": 693, "e": 697}, {"w": "full,", "f": 699, "e": 715}, {"w": "so", "f": 718, "e": 725}, {"w": "they", "f": 727, "e": 729}, {"w": "attach", "f": 734, "e": 738}, {"w": "paper.", "f": 741, "e": 754}]}, {"a": 768, "b": 860, "text": "In two thousand three, Yale buys it at auction.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 770, "e": 775}, {"w": "two", "f": 777, "e": 779}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 782, "e": 789}, {"w": "three,", "f": 793, "e": 809}, {"w": "Yale", "f": 811, "e": 818}, {"w": "buys", "f": 821, "e": 827}, {"w": "it", "f": 830, "e": 831}, {"w": "at", "f": 832, "e": 834}, {"w": "auction.", "f": 841, "e": 855}]}, {"a": 860, "b": 1033, "text": "Twelve years later, it collects. One hundred thirty-six euros, for twelve years.", "words": [{"w": "Twelve", "f": 862, "e": 869}, {"w": "years", "f": 871, "e": 878}, {"w": "later,", "f": 880, "e": 891}, {"w": "it", "f": 894, "e": 896}, {"w": "collects.", "f": 898, "e": 914}, {"w": "One", "f": 930, "e": 935}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 937, "e": 944}, {"w": "thirty-six", "f": 949, "e": 965}, {"w": "euros,", "f": 967, "e": 985}, {"w": "for", "f": 987, "e": 990}, {"w": "twelve", "f": 992, "e": 1003}, {"w": "years.", "f": 1006, "e": 1019}]}, {"a": 1033, "b": 1093, "text": "So where did the money go?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 1035, "e": 1040}, {"w": "where", "f": 1047, "e": 1051}, {"w": "did", "f": 1053, "e": 1054}, {"w": "the", "f": 1056, "e": 1057}, {"w": "money", "f": 1058, "e": 1065}, {"w": "go?", "f": 1067, "e": 1074}]}, {"a": 1093, "b": 1239, "text": "You see, it's like grandma's birthday card with the same five dollars, every year.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1095, "e": 1097}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1099, "e": 1111}, {"w": "it's", "f": 1113, "e": 1115}, {"w": "like", "f": 1118, "e": 1122}, {"w": "grandma's", "f": 1126, "e": 1136}, {"w": "birthday", "f": 1142, "e": 1147}, {"w": "card", "f": 1150, "e": 1157}, {"w": "with", "f": 1159, "e": 1161}, {"w": "the", "f": 1163, "e": 1166}, {"w": "same", "f": 1168, "e": 1175}, {"w": "five", "f": 1177, "e": 1184}, {"w": "dollars,", "f": 1186, "e": 1203}, {"w": "every", "f": 1207, "e": 1216}, {"w": "year.", "f": 1218, "e": 1230}]}, {"a": 1239, "b": 1360, "text": "The card never changes. What five dollars buys does.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1241, "e": 1243}, {"w": "card", "f": 1246, "e": 1253}, {"w": "never", "f": 1255, "e": 1259}, {"w": "changes.", "f": 1262, "e": 1278}, {"w": "What", "f": 1289, "e": 1294}, {"w": "five", "f": 1296, "e": 1301}, {"w": "dollars", "f": 1303, "e": 1312}, {"w": "buys", "f": 1317, "e": 1330}, {"w": "does.", "f": 1333, "e": 1346}]}, {"a": 1360, "b": 1472, "text": "Prices rose for centuries, and every coin shrank.", "words": [{"w": "Prices", "f": 1362, "e": 1376}, {"w": "rose", "f": 1378, "e": 1385}, {"w": "for", "f": 1387, "e": 1392}, {"w": "centuries,", "f": 1394, "e": 1415}, {"w": "and", "f": 1417, "e": 1419}, {"w": "every", "f": 1422, "e": 1431}, {"w": "coin", "f": 1433, "e": 1442}, {"w": "shrank.", "f": 1445, "e": 1458}]}, {"a": 1472, "b": 1589, "text": "Today, forever pays eleven euros thirty-five a year.", "words": [{"w": "Today,", "f": 1474, "e": 1493}, {"w": "forever", "f": 1497, "e": 1506}, {"w": "pays", "f": 1511, "e": 1518}, {"w": "eleven", "f": 1521, "e": 1529}, {"w": "euros", "f": 1531, "e": 1543}, {"w": "thirty-five", "f": 1545, "e": 1559}, {"w": "a", "f": 1561, "e": 1563}, {"w": "year.", "f": 1566, "e": 1575}]}, {"a": 1589, "b": 1641, "text": "Every promise was kept.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "f": 1591, "e": 1600}, {"w": "promise", "f": 1602, "e": 1614}, {"w": "was", "f": 1616, "e": 1618}, {"w": "kept.", "f": 1621, "e": 1632}]}, {"a": 1641, "b": 1709, "text": "The money just melted.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1643, "e": 1646}, {"w": "money", "f": 1648, "e": 1657}, {"w": "just", "f": 1664, "e": 1669}, {"w": "melted.", "f": 1671, "e": 1691}]}]}